# Paths kept out of the knowledge graph.

# Next.js build output. Glob, not exact names: this project uses several
# output dirs (.next, .next-build, .next-test, .next-walkthrough) because
# `next build` and `next dev` must not share one. Minified bundles otherwise
# dominate clustering and produce god nodes like e()/u()/i() that are webpack
# internals, not this project's abstractions.
web/.next*/

# A superseded cut of the same product. Its ADRs contradict the current
